@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### List risks, highest residual first
GET {{baseUrl}}/risks?sort=residualScore,desc

### Filter by category and status
GET {{baseUrl}}/risks?category=SECURITY&status=OPEN&sort=residualScore,desc

### Create a risk
POST {{baseUrl}}/risks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Privileged account compromise",
  "description": "An attacker may gain privileged access to production systems.",
  "category": "SECURITY",
  "owner": "Security Engineering",
  "likelihood": 5,
  "impact": 4,
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Replace RISK_ID with the id returned above
@riskId = RISK_ID

### Add a mitigation
POST {{baseUrl}}/risks/{{riskId}}/mitigations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Require phishing-resistant MFA for privileged access",
  "effectiveness": 5
}

### Fetch recalculated details
GET {{baseUrl}}/risks/{{riskId}}
